# Stage 3 feature collection (scripts/train_stage3.sh): settings shared by every collection cell.
# = the Stage 2 training recipe + ground-truth box observations (no perception noise model)
#   + the latent observation (25-frame window, camera frame, 53 x 40 deg visibility rectangle, 2-frame delay) + per-env random box
#   colours, under the evaluator's default protocol (no CLEAN2 knobs). Loaded first; then a throw block
#   (stage3_throw_canon.env or stage3_throw_offset.env) and, for the teacher pass, stage3_teacher_boxmix.env.
